WEBVTT

00:00:03.435 --> 00:00:05.270
- (tires squeal)
- Whoa!

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:06.739
Get in.

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:07.606
(grunts)

00:00:07.706 --> 00:00:09.842
We've got a baby to save.

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:13.645
(tires squealing)

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:19.084
- (laughs) We got him!
- (Valentina laughing)

00:00:19.184 --> 00:00:22.588
Oh, who is ready to become
a little roach?

00:00:22.688 --> 00:00:24.556
- Ow! Let go!
- (Gru Jr. laughs, squeals)

00:00:24.656 --> 00:00:26.492
Ow! Those are very sensitive.

00:00:26.592 --> 00:00:28.526
Aah! You squirmy little...

00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:29.762
- (liquid trickling)
- MAXIME: Oh!

00:00:29.862 --> 00:00:32.664
- (giggles, coos)
- Ugh! Are you kidding me?

00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:35.267
You got pee-pee
all over my ship.

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:36.969
(giggling)

00:00:37.069 --> 00:00:40.506
Valentina, bring me
the Roachification Ray.

00:00:40.606 --> 00:00:42.041
(giggles, gasps)

00:00:42.141 --> 00:00:43.942
♪

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:45.644
There they are.

00:00:47.446 --> 00:00:49.415
I'm on it.

00:00:49.515 --> 00:00:51.950
Here we go!

00:00:54.453 --> 00:00:56.155
(laughing)

00:00:56.255 --> 00:00:57.589
(screams)

00:00:57.689 --> 00:01:00.159
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:01:00.259 --> 00:01:01.960
(yelps)

00:01:04.196 --> 00:01:05.664
(whimpering)

00:01:05.764 --> 00:01:08.167
- (radar pinging)
- What's that? (gasps)

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:10.369
(chuckles) Hello.

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:12.237
(groans) Gru!

00:01:12.337 --> 00:01:14.673
Get me closer.

00:01:16.608 --> 00:01:18.210
Almost there.

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:19.611
(grunts)

00:01:19.711 --> 00:01:21.747
- Take them out!
- (Valentina chuckles)

00:01:21.847 --> 00:01:23.515
- (Gru yelps, grunts)
- (Poppy screaming)

00:01:23.615 --> 00:01:25.951
(both yelling)

00:01:26.051 --> 00:01:27.853
(screams)

00:01:27.953 --> 00:01:29.088
(grunts)

00:01:32.791 --> 00:01:34.993
You're doing great!

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:39.731
(grunts)

00:01:40.399 --> 00:01:42.668
Go get 'em, partner.

00:01:46.238 --> 00:01:48.740
(screams, gasps)

00:01:50.242 --> 00:01:52.010
(grunts)

00:01:52.111 --> 00:01:53.546
(Valentina gasps)

00:01:53.645 --> 00:01:54.713
(laughing)

00:01:54.813 --> 00:01:57.416
(frightened whimpering)

00:01:57.516 --> 00:01:58.551
(Gru screams)

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:01.019
Ay! I can't see!

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:02.589
(yelps)

00:02:02.688 --> 00:02:05.424
(all screaming)

00:02:05.524 --> 00:02:08.127
(whimpering)

00:02:08.227 --> 00:02:10.129
(grunts, gasps)

00:02:13.499 --> 00:02:15.033
(grunts)

00:02:15.134 --> 00:02:16.268
(coughing)

00:02:16.368 --> 00:02:18.137
Junior.

00:02:18.837 --> 00:02:21.039
MAXIME:
(laughs) Don't worry, Gru.

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:22.674
The baby is fine.

00:02:22.774 --> 00:02:24.443
See for yourself.

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:26.245
(Gru Jr. coos)

00:02:27.513 --> 00:02:29.549
(gasps)
Oh, Junior.

00:02:29.648 --> 00:02:31.383
And now he belongs to me.

00:02:31.483 --> 00:02:33.519
Isn't that right, Maxime Jr.?

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:34.953
(Gru Jr. coos)

00:02:35.053 --> 00:02:37.923
Together, we will wreak havoc,
cause mayhem

00:02:38.023 --> 00:02:40.325
and have so much fun
doing it, huh?

00:02:40.425 --> 00:02:41.960
(both laughing)

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:44.597
And best of all, he hates you!

00:02:44.696 --> 00:02:46.198
He really does.

00:02:46.298 --> 00:02:48.233
Let my son go.

00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:49.701
No, I don't think so.

00:02:49.801 --> 00:02:53.205
The fun is just about
to start, huh?

00:02:53.305 --> 00:02:55.807
(laughing)

00:02:56.576 --> 00:02:59.044
(screams, gasps)

00:02:59.144 --> 00:03:00.212
(screams)

00:03:02.014 --> 00:03:05.618
Oh, look at what a coward
your old daddy is, huh?

00:03:05.717 --> 00:03:07.486
(Maxime laughing)

00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:09.121
(gasping)

00:03:12.224 --> 00:03:13.692
(laughing)

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:17.029
(yelps, screams)

00:03:17.129 --> 00:03:18.764
(gasps)

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:21.200
- (gasps)
- (rumbling)

00:03:24.503 --> 00:03:26.338
(Valentina screams)

00:03:26.438 --> 00:03:29.208
(panting)

00:03:29.308 --> 00:03:31.109
(growls)

00:03:31.944 --> 00:03:34.681
You crossed the line, Maxime.

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:36.583
Now, give me my son.

00:03:36.683 --> 00:03:40.052
I told you, he is my son now.

00:03:40.152 --> 00:03:42.054
(gasping)

00:03:42.154 --> 00:03:44.389
(yells)

00:03:44.489 --> 00:03:46.992
(both grunting)

00:03:47.092 --> 00:03:48.227
(gasps)

00:03:48.327 --> 00:03:49.328
(grunts)

00:03:49.428 --> 00:03:50.762
(grunts, laughs)

00:03:50.862 --> 00:03:52.665
- Watch your step, Gru.
- (gasps, whimpers)

00:03:52.764 --> 00:03:54.199
It's a doozy!

00:03:54.299 --> 00:03:54.967
(laughs)

00:03:55.067 --> 00:03:57.202
Too bad you can't fly, huh?

00:03:57.302 --> 00:03:59.171
(grunting)

00:04:01.873 --> 00:04:04.176
(Gru screaming)

00:04:04.276 --> 00:04:05.545
- Let go!
- Ow!

00:04:05.645 --> 00:04:06.613
(groaning)

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:08.947
(screaming)

00:04:09.649 --> 00:04:11.950
(both grunting)

00:04:14.386 --> 00:04:16.154
(gasps, grunts)

00:04:17.456 --> 00:04:18.890
This ends now!

00:04:18.991 --> 00:04:20.727
Say goodbye to Daddy.

00:04:20.826 --> 00:04:22.294
(Gru Jr. chatters)

00:04:24.496 --> 00:04:26.733
(gasps)

00:04:26.832 --> 00:04:29.434
It's okay, Junior.

00:04:29.534 --> 00:04:32.070
Dada loves you.

00:04:33.606 --> 00:04:34.806
(laughs)

00:04:34.906 --> 00:04:37.075
(Gru screaming)

00:04:39.278 --> 00:04:42.014
(yelps, screams)

00:04:42.114 --> 00:04:44.316
(Gru groaning, screaming)

00:04:49.589 --> 00:04:51.323
(gasps)

00:04:51.423 --> 00:04:52.291
(laughing)

00:04:52.391 --> 00:04:53.325
(screams)

00:04:53.425 --> 00:04:54.594
(gasps)

00:04:54.694 --> 00:04:55.762
- (Maxime groaning)
- (thud)

00:04:55.861 --> 00:04:57.296
Get back here.

00:04:57.396 --> 00:04:58.598
Bad baby.

00:04:58.698 --> 00:04:59.798
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:04:59.898 --> 00:05:01.300
Get off me, you demon! (groans)

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.569
You are going to feel
the wrath of...

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:04.737
(yells)

00:05:04.836 --> 00:05:06.305
(gasps, whimpers)

00:05:06.405 --> 00:05:08.040
(screams)

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:09.408
(laughs)

00:05:09.508 --> 00:05:11.810
(screaming)

00:05:12.578 --> 00:05:14.212
(groans, whimpers)

00:05:14.313 --> 00:05:15.480
(screams)

00:05:15.581 --> 00:05:16.683
(groans) Whoa.

00:05:16.783 --> 00:05:18.050
(screams)

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:19.451
(groans)

00:05:19.552 --> 00:05:21.920
(screams)

00:05:23.855 --> 00:05:25.190
(pained whimper)

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:26.258
(grunts)

00:05:27.627 --> 00:05:29.696
See? Not a scratch.

00:05:29.796 --> 00:05:31.698
- Huh? Wha...?
- (cattle bellowing)

00:05:31.798 --> 00:05:34.499
Salami!

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.301
(screams)

00:05:36.401 --> 00:05:37.969
Pastrami!

00:05:38.771 --> 00:05:39.971
(screams, whimpers)

00:05:40.072 --> 00:05:41.940
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:44.209
MINION:
Prosciutto!

00:05:45.143 --> 00:05:46.813
- What? (coughs)
- Prosciutto!

00:05:46.912 --> 00:05:48.548
Ew, ew, ew, ew, ew!

00:05:48.648 --> 00:05:49.682
- Gross.
- (bees buzzing)

00:05:49.782 --> 00:05:51.983
(panicked whimpering)

00:05:52.918 --> 00:05:55.987
(sighs) Nice try. When I...

00:05:57.089 --> 00:05:58.890
- (laughs)
- (Maxime whimpers)

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:01.661
- Antipasti. (chuckles)
- (camera clicks)

00:06:01.761 --> 00:06:03.730
(chuckling)

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:06.098
- (tires squealing)
- (laughs): Oh!

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.868
- Gru! -Oh, Gru!
- You're here!

00:06:09.968 --> 00:06:12.471
Junior! (laughs, whoops)

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:16.743
Yes!

00:06:16.843 --> 00:06:18.076
- AGNES: Yay!
- EDITH: Holy cow!

00:06:18.176 --> 00:06:19.812
- LUCY: Are you guys okay?
- MARGO: That was insane!

00:06:19.911 --> 00:06:21.313
- (Lucy sighs)
- (Gru chuckles)

00:06:21.413 --> 00:06:23.081
(Gru Jr. cooing)

00:06:24.617 --> 00:06:26.418
Dada.

00:06:26.518 --> 00:06:28.353
(gasps)

00:06:30.389 --> 00:06:32.290
ALL:
Aw.

00:06:32.391 --> 00:06:34.126
Aw. My boys.

00:06:34.226 --> 00:06:35.927
- Dada.
- (Gru sniffles)

00:06:36.027 --> 00:06:38.063
(crying): You know something,
today has been

00:06:38.163 --> 00:06:41.166
a real roller coaster
of emotion.

00:06:41.266 --> 00:06:42.934
- (whimpers)
- (Gru Jr. giggling)

00:06:43.034 --> 00:06:45.137
(Minions chuckling)

00:06:45.237 --> 00:06:46.606
Uh, Gru?

00:06:46.706 --> 00:06:48.974
Can we go back home now?

